# select:file.directory returns directories, and the root as ./.
args: search 'repo:^github\.com/gorilla/websocket$@v1.5.3 select:file.directory upgrade'
exit: 0
--- stdout
4+ directories  1 repo  0.6 s
query  repo:^github\.com/gorilla/websocket$@v1.5.3 select:file.directory upgrade

github.com/gorilla/websocket@ce903f6d1d96:examples/chat/
github.com/gorilla/websocket@ce903f6d1d96:examples/echo/
github.com/gorilla/websocket@ce903f6d1d96:examples/command/
github.com/gorilla/websocket@ce903f6d1d96:./
--- stderr
sego: note: at a pinned revision, select: keeps only what each repository's first 30 matches hold; count:all gives every one
